{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23348","headline":"自问行何迟 · 白居易","name":"自问行何迟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前月发京口，今辰次淮涯。\n二旬四百里，自问行何迟。\n还乡无他计，罢郡有余资。\n进不慕富贵，退未忧寒饥。\n以此易过日，腾腾何所爲。\n逢山輙倚櫂，遇寺多题诗。\n酒醒夜深後，睡足日高时。\n眼底一无事，心中百不知。\n想到京国日，嬾放亦如斯。\n何必冒风水，促促赴程归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}